Did you take out the box with the 1, 2 and 4 in it?

Did you use the magic wand to copy the box with the 8 in it?

Did you try joining the box with 1, 2 and 4 to the one with 8?

Did you copy the 8 and drop the copy on it to make 16?

Did you copy the box with 16 in it?

Did you join it with the box with 1, 2, 4 and 8?

Did you double the 16 and join the box with 32 in it to the other box?

Did you remember to get up holding the box with 1, 2, 4, 8, 16,
and 32 in it?

Well, here's what I would do if I could.  I'd take out the box
with 1, 2 and 4 in it and drop it on the floor.  I'd pick up
the magic wand and copy the box with the 8 in it.  I'd add one
of the boxes with an 8 to the edge of the box with 1, 2 and 4.
Then I'd copy the 8 and drop the copy on it to make 16.  I'd
copy the box with 16 in it and join one copy with the other box.
I'd copy the 16 to make 32 and drop that box at the end of the
other box. Then I'd pick up the resulting box.

